                "message": "Fix box click in the relationship-annotator browser graph and add keyboard recentre\n\nThe page captured the pointer on every press, so the browser sent the\nclick to the svg and never to the box. Capture the pointer only once a\ndrag starts. Boxes can now be focused with Tab and recentre on Enter.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Lx85KjAnE44RFKN3P8Qb15",
                "tree": {
